#: includes/Admin/Page.php:585
msgid "How Pro works"
msgstr "Kako Pro funkcionira"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:586
msgid "Pay securely through Paddle."
msgstr "Platite sigurno putem Paddlea."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:587
msgid "Download SmokyPost Pro with the button below."
msgstr "Preuzmite SmokyPost Pro gumbom u nastavku."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:587
msgid "Come back to this page. A \"Download SmokyPost Pro\" button appears, and we e-mail you the same link."
msgstr "Vratite se na ovu stranicu. Pojavit će se gumb „Preuzmi SmokyPost Pro”, a istu poveznicu poslat ćemo vam i e-poštom."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:588
msgid "Install it under Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin and activate it. Your license is picked up automatically, there is no key to enter."
msgstr "Instalirajte ga u Dodaci > Dodaj novi > Učitaj dodatak i aktivirajte ga. Vaša se licenca prepoznaje automatski, ne morate unositi ključ."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:589
msgid "SmokyPost Pro is a second plugin that works together with SmokyPost: keep both active. It takes about a minute. Full refund within 14 days of your first payment."
msgstr "SmokyPost Pro drugi je dodatak koji radi zajedno sa SmokyPostom: ostavite oba aktivna. Traje otprilike minutu. Potpuni povrat novca unutar 14 dana od prve uplate."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:603
msgid "Your payment is taking longer than usual to show here. Reload this page in a few minutes. If your plan is still Free after an hour, write to info@smokypost.com."
msgstr "Vašoj se uplati duže nego inače treba pojaviti ovdje. Osvježite stranicu za nekoliko minuta. Ako je vaš paket nakon sat vremena i dalje Free, pišite na info@smokypost.com."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:607
msgid "Payment received. Your plan will be active in a moment, this page checks again by itself."
msgstr "Uplata je primljena. Vaš će paket uskoro postati aktivan, a ova će stranica to sama provjeriti."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:619
msgid "SmokyPost Pro"
